+      "mechanism": "F-141 producer fix: KV cells freed by seq_rm / a rewind are zeroed before any later read, inside the mid-decode window bound [n_kv_prev, n_kv), with a transposed-V block assert and one INFO line naming the zeroing. Unset or LLAMA_ARIFI_KV_ZERO_FREED=1 = zeroing on (default ON since b0b41ed548); =0 = the merge-base path.",
