-      "measured_effect": "When ON: F-nondet 4 -> 0 on S-NF (-fa off history == fresh, bit-equal); decode cost QM pooled +0.45% (floor 0.87%), OO pooled -0.31% / -3.23% (floors 0.38% / 7.33%). When OFF (default): identical to the merge base.",
-      "opt_out": "default OFF; LLAMA_ARIFI_KV_ZERO_FREED=1 opts in"
+      "measured_effect": "When ON: F-nondet 4 -> 0 on S-NF (-fa off history == fresh, bit-equal); decode cost QM pooled +0.45% (floor 0.87%), OO pooled -0.31% / -3.23% (floors 0.38% / 7.33%); a measured cost, not a speed win. =0: identical to the merge base.",
